TASK 2 — "Respuestas exitosas" viewer in Profile Pruebas
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Created:
- test/ui/success_log_ui_test.dart
    Asserts the sheet title, status, label, URL, local timestamp, and the
    expandable request/response bodies; plus the empty state.

Modified:
- lib/ui/molecules/tests_panel.dart
    New optional successLogRepository + 'Respuestas exitosas' button
    (key settings_success_logs_button); showSuccessLogSheet() with
    success_log_sheet_title / success_log_list / success_log_request_body_<id> /
    success_log_response_body_<id>. Spanish/English copy mirroring the error
    viewer.
- lib/ui/pages/profile_page.dart, lib/ui/pages/main_shell_page.dart, lib/app.dart
    Threaded the repository from the app composition root to the Pruebas panel;
    mock flavor uses MockSuccessLogRepository, real flavors use
    LocalSuccessLogRepository, and it is injected into AiDiagnosisRepository.

Commit: feat(m58): surface 'Respuestas exitosas' viewer in Profile Pruebas panel

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TASK 3 — Exact backend response mapping (diagnosticReport / mealSuggestions)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Rationale: the parser previously injected generic educational placeholder copy
when fields were missing, which masked the true backend payload.

Created:
- test/models/ai_diagnosis_payload_mapping_test.dart
    Binds diagnosticReport (string and object forms) and mealSuggestions; asserts
    no placeholder substitution (empty title/summary/meal name when absent).

Modified:
- lib/core/models/ai_diagnosis.dart
    AiDiagnosisReport.fromJson now prefers diagnosticReport (string or object:
    summary/report/diagnosis) and mealSuggestions (wrapped into a single menu),
    while remaining tolerant of legacy title/summary/menus keys. Removed the
    'Clinical nutrition report'/'Informe de nutrición clínica',
    'Suggested menu'/'Menú sugerido' and 'Suggested meal'/'Comida sugerida'
    fallbacks.
- test/data/ai_diagnosis_repository_test.dart
    Updated the optional-fields test to assert an empty (not placeholder) title.

Commit: feat(m58): bind diagnosis UI to diagnosticReport and mealSuggestions payloads

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TASK 4 — Overwrite confirmation dialog
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Created:
- test/ui/ai_diagnosis_overwrite_confirmation_test.dart
    Confirmation shown when a valid diagnosis exists; cancel issues no request
    and keeps the saved report; confirm regenerates; no prompt when empty.

Modified:
- lib/ui/molecules/ai_diagnosis_controls.dart
    _generate() now awaits _confirmOverwrite() when _latest != null.
    AlertDialog (key ai_diagnosis_overwrite_dialog) content:
    "¿Está seguro de que desea volver a generar el diagnóstico?" with
    ai_diagnosis_overwrite_cancel / ai_diagnosis_overwrite_confirm actions.

Commit: feat(m58): confirm before overwriting a saved AI diagnosis

